    <string name="about_description">CountCurrent is a mobile utility application designed to estimate monthly residential electricity bills based on TNB (Tenaga Nasional Berhad) tiered block rates in Malaysia. It features full offline database capabilities using Firebase Firestore offline cache support, enabling seamless usage even without active internet.</string>
    
    <string name="about_instructions_title">How to Use Instructions:</string>
    <string name="about_instruction_1">1. Select the billing month from the dropdown menu.</string>
    <string name="about_instruction_2">2. Enter or slide the number of kWh units used (ranging 1–1000).</string>
    <string name="about_instruction_3">3. Choose your rebate percentage (0% to 5%).</string>
    <string name="about_instruction_4">4. Tap "Calculate" to view the estimated charges and save it.</string>
    <string name="about_instruction_5">5. Tap "View Records" to view your historical saved estimations.</string>
    <string name="about_instruction_6">6. Tap any record in the list to view details, update, or delete it.</string>
